            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 151444,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Linguagens de programação como Python permitem que você escreva programas que os computadores podem executar.</p><p>Clique no trecho de código <code>print(\"Hello, World\")</code> para adicioná-lo ao editor de código. Em seguida, clique no botão abaixo para executar o programa.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, World&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, World\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print(\"Hello, World\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 151451,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os programas geralmente precisam memorizar informações. As variáveis tornam isso possível.</p><p>Clique no trecho de código para criar uma variável chamada <code>name</code>. Em seguida, clique no botão abaixo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>name = \"Virginia\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 151448,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agora o programa pode usar a variável <code>name</code>.</p><p>Adicione <code>name</code> à linha incompleta e execute o programa.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", name)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Virginia\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 151450,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um programa pode executar várias instruções em ordem.</p><p>Use os trechos de código para formar <code>print(\"How are you?\")</code> no editor de código. Depois, clique no botão abaixo para ver o resultado.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;How are you?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Virginia\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"How are you?\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>\"How are you?\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
